# Library of Leng: Faithless Looting discards the Lightning Bolt and the Island together, and Bot1 puts both on top of the
# library. Two cards put on top of a library at once are in the order their owner chooses (CR 401.4; the rulings: "you get
# to decide the order"): the Island, discarded last, would lie on top, and Bot1 puts the Bolt above it. The order is
# Bot1's alone and the cards were not revealed (the rulings), so Bot2 sees no top card. The discard is still a discard
# (CR 701.9a; the rulings: "the discard triggers anything else that triggers on discards"): Hobgoblin's "whenever you
# discard a card" triggers for each card, 1 + 2 + 2 power.
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Hobgoblin, Mantled Marauder
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Island
Forest
Forest
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Hobgoblin, Mantled Marauder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt; Island)
? Bot1.Library.Top = Lightning Bolt
? Bot2.Sees.Bot1.LibraryTop = (hidden)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library = Lightning Bolt; Island; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Hobgoblin, Mantled Marauder.Power = 5
